# Built pack zips
/dist/
*.zip

# Personal, never committed
CLAUDE.local.md

# Agent orchestration state — session-scoped and machine-local. A pattern rather than the
# bare directory because the tooling treats `.omc/skills/**` as committable, and git does not
# descend into an ignored directory, so `.omc/` alone would make that negation unreachable.
# That exception is the agent tooling's own convention and is deliberately not documented in
# this repo's CLAUDE.md — nothing here depends on it, and no such directory exists yet.
.omc/*
!.omc/skills/
